# Title 26 of the United States Code, the Internal Revenue Code, as in force
# for 2025, including the amendments of Public Law 119-21. Its sections are
# addressed by citation. The sections the rules cite are listed with their
# headings, from the 2024 edition on GovInfo, or from P.L. 119-21 for the
# sections it inserted. No copy is kept yet: the
# sections are read on the Office of the Law Revision Counsel's site.

